---
title: Venturia
description: The mobile-first wiki hub for Venturia - people, places, factions, maps, lore, and the fog at the city's edge.
published: true
date: 2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z
editor: markdown
dateCreated: 2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z
autoIndex: false
---

<div class="vos-wiki-hub">
  <section class="vos-section-header" aria-labelledby="vos-wiki-title">
    <p class="vos-section-kicker">Campaign Wiki</p>
    <h1 class="vos-section-title" id="vos-wiki-title">Venturia</h1>
    <p class="vos-section-subtitle">Search first, then jump into the campaign sections: people, places, factions, history, maps, and the table record.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="vos-compact-panel vos-wiki-search-panel" aria-labelledby="vos-wiki-search-title">
    <div class="vos-panel-head">
      <h2 class="vos-panel-title" id="vos-wiki-search-title">Search The Wiki</h2>
      <span class="vos-panel-note">NPCs, locations, lore</span>
    </div>
    <div id="vos-wiki-search"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="vos-wiki-status-grid" aria-label="Current campaign context">
    <div class="vos-compact-panel">
      <div class="vos-panel-head">
        <h2 class="vos-panel-title">In Play</h2>
        <span class="vos-panel-note">{{ campaign.latestSession.arc }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vos-row-chip-list">
        {% for item in campaign.inPlay %}
          {% if loop.index0 < 5 %}
          <a class="vos-row-chip" href="{{ item.link }}">
            <span>
              <span class="vos-row-chip-title">{{ item.name }}</span>
              <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">{{ item.role }} · {{ item.kind }}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">{{ item.emblem }}</span>
          </a>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="vos-compact-panel">
      <div class="vos-panel-head">
        <h2 class="vos-panel-title">Latest</h2>
        <span class="vos-panel-note">{{ campaign.latestSession.updated }}</span>
      </div>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="{{ campaign.latestSession.link }}">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">{{ campaign.latestSession.title }}</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">{{ campaign.latestSession.recap }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vos-wiki-sections" aria-labelledby="vos-wiki-sections-title">
    <div class="vos-section-header">
      <p class="vos-section-kicker">Section Nav</p>
      <h2 class="vos-section-title" id="vos-wiki-sections-title">Browse</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="vos-row-chip-grid">
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Characters/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Characters</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">PCs, NPCs, council members, families, patrons, and legends.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Cast</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Culture/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Culture</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Masks, festivals, vernacular, public ritual, and private habit.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Life</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Factions/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Factions</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Faith, commerce, theater, law, contracts, and city power.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Pwr</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Government/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Government</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">The Autumn Council, its vacant seat, and political deadlocks.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Gov</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Locations/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Locations</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Districts, institutions, guildhalls, canals, sanctuaries, and the Overlook.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">City</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Lore/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Lore</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Vallombrosa's legends, Eldoria's past, prosperity, and fey-touch.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Lore</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Items/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Items</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Named equipment, heirlooms, magic items, and objects with history.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Gear</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/submit-lore/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Submit Lore</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Draft an item, person, place, faction, or lore entry for DM review.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Draft</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Venturia/Maps/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Maps</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">World, city, quadrant, campus, and deep-zoom reference maps.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Map</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vos-row-chip" href="/en/Session-Chronicles/">
        <span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-title">Session Chronicles</span>
          <span class="vos-row-chip-meta">Campaign records, table memory, and the story as it moves forward.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vos-row-chip-badge" aria-hidden="true">Play</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
